stb_image.h and stb_image_write.h, by Sean Barrett and contributors, vendored
unmodified from https://github.com/nothings/stb at commit
9600522de53973336fa033a289858a4354cbb04c (cloned 2026-11-17). LICENSE is the
upstream file: public domain or MIT, at the user's choice (we take MIT).
They are included from exactly one translation unit, src/laser/raster_image.cpp,
with warnings suppressed for that file only. Used to decode PNG/JPEG/BMP/GIF
for raster engraving and to write the dithered preview PNG (stb_image_write
rather than a hand-rolled stored-deflate encoder: it is the same vendor, same
licence, and compresses).
